      "heading": "",
      "text": "A schematic comparison can show two equally sized rural populations. A's homes cluster near a shared water point and school; B's homes are spaced across separate agricultural plots with road access. The pattern differences can be explained through the stated resource and land-use arrangements. Neither record establishes a difference in wealth or national development category unless additional evidence is supplied.",
