    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.02-13",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A supported comparison therefore uses matched factors on both sides. Describe relief with relief, access with access and land organisation with land organisation. A statement that one settlement has a road while the other has fertile soil does not directly compare the same dimension. Linking each factor to feasible sites and livelihood choices gives a coherent explanation without treating the broad country labels as causes in themselves.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-3.3.02-1",
        "CL-6137-3.3.02-2",
        "CL-6137-3.3.02-01-1",
        "CL-6137-3.3.02-01-2",
